  "question": {
    "text": "<p>What is the energy stored in the capacitor (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μJ</mi></math> ) between terminals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>'</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>'</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>'</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>'</mo></math> of the network (as shown in figure)?If capacitance of each capacitor is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>μF</mi></math>.</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/123aswda.PNG\" style=\"width: 151px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "12.50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Redrawing network, we get a balanced Wheatstone's network.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-05-24_at_10.51.00_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 127px;\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-05-24_at_10.51.19_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 121px;\" /></p><p>Charge on capacitor between terminals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Energy stored in that capacitor<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>C</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>CV</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>",
